[{"title":"题秋林读书图","author":"史谨","text":"不随麟凤谒虞廷，独坐林间味六经。\n风叶向秋俱落尽，隔江遥见数峰青。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题桃源图","author":"史谨","text":"仙境萦回一水通，人家住处绝尘踪。\n渔郎忽到惊相问，犹说当年避祖龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江楼晚眺","author":"史谨","text":"一汀红蓼乱飞鸥，两岸芦花覆钓舟。\n此景合教谁管领，水边人在夕阳楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题虎图","author":"史谨","text":"目光如电气如云，独踞松阴啸夕曛。\n莫道横行为己任，汉家自有李将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题马图","author":"史谨","text":"沙场百战已成功，万里归来汗血空。\n莫道邦家无惠养，满川苜蓿雁来红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题鹡鸰图","author":"史谨","text":"止则同原飞则鸣，野花芳草共怡情。\n幽禽尚有相亲意，何况人间弟与兄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":48379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口号次韵","author":"史谨","text":"万壑烟岚昼未乾，半空和翠滴衣寒。\n老夫至此还吟眺，系马松阴暂卸鞍。","collection